: T1=150+273.15=423.15K, T2=160+273.15=433.15K, Ea=90000 J/mol, R=8.314;
Arrhenius time = 10 x exp((90000/8.314)x(1/433.15 - 1/423.15)) ≈ 10 x 0.5509 = 5.5 min;
van't Hoff approximation = 10 / 2^(10/10) = 5.0 min;
curing rate multiple = 10 / 5.5 ≈ 1.81x.
